][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]recover_handoff_lost_edits.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/recover_handoff_lost_edits.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1ph[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1ph/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore the lost sase-core ToolRun contention and quarantine [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]fix (sase-1p6)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-contention[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-contention: apply the replayed sase-1ou.land patch to sase-core [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](contention.rs test budgets plus the connection.rs open/quarantine fix),[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify it with the governed sase-core check, and close sase-1p6 with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fresh evidence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore the lost sase flake-baseline reconciliation[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]flake-baseline[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]flake-baseline: apply the replayed sase-1ou.land edit to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests/reproducible_flake_baseline.txt, rerun the selection-health flake [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate, and reconcile any drift since 2026-10-28 20:14Z.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Re-implement nested committed-plan validation read context in [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sase[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]nested-plans-validation[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nested-plans-validation: make validate_committed_plans resolve a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repo-open nested checkout's own plans before the inherited [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]SASE_SDD_PLANS_DIR, re-implementing the change bob-cli-dp.land--code [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]made and lost.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore bob-cli's manual-heading-number predicate fix[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]heading-predicate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]heading-predicate: apply the recovered bob-cli-d7.land--code patch to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli src/native/highlights_ref/create.rs (has_manual_number plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pandoc-backed regressions) and verify it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Port bob-cli's lost theme-rename trailing-whitespace verifier [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]fix[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rename-verifier[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename-verifier: reproduce, then port onto current master, the lost [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-dd.land--code fix that lets verify_renamed accept byte-preserved[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trailing whitespace after a Pomodoro name while still rejecting [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collateral edits.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1ph","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1ph.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f11399a06d8e3358a3a133677c136765","started_at":"2026-10-29T00:07:23.354658+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ph.land"]